IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `irda-bankruptcy`

-- Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018, ss 290, 291, 310-316, 318, 329, 361-363, 395-397, 400, 401, 404, 412, 413, 417 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_insolvency-restructuring-and-dissolution-act-2018.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

